<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva inflation speeds up to 0.5 pct y/y in June.</title>
<headline>Geneva inflation speeds up to 0.5 pct y/y in June.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geneva consumer prices rose 0.1 percent in June from May for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.5 percent, the cantonal statistics office said.</p>
<p>				June 97	May 97     June 96</p>
<p> Monthly change in pct  +0.1	   -0.1	 +0.1</p>
<p> Yr/Yr change	     +0.5	   +0.4	 +0.5</p>
<p> Index (May 1993=100)  104.4	  104.2	103.9</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
